  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a unique way to welcome guests, featuring uplifting Bible verses and scripture-based designs. It combines faith-based aesthetics with practical functionality, making it a thoughtful accent for any entryway. Crafted for comfort and durability, this doormat serves as a beautiful expression of faith at your doorstep.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with family name, initial, or custom text alongside Bible verses.</li>\n<li>Features inspirational backgrounds with scripture-based designs.</li>\n<li>Soft, lightweight, and comfortable underfoot with durable material.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor use and covered outdoor areas.</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain with simple methods.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Bible Doormat 01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Faux Wool, Polyester Fabric, Memory Stretch Sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Suede</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>For spilled liquid, gently soak up with a dry duster cloth or clean with water. For solid waste, use a hand-held vacuum cleaner, sweep with a broom, or shake off outdoors. For deeper cleaning, wipe with a damp cloth and mild soap, or flush outdoors with a garden hose.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is ideal for entrances, front porches, or entryways, providing a warm welcome to guests. It can be used both indoors and outside covered doorways, adding a personal and faith-inspired touch to your home decor.</p>",
